# Laravel Engineering Blueprint

Follow Phase 0: `laravel-engineering-blueprint/docs/PHASE-0.md` and linked specs.

- Modules: `app/Modules/{Name}/` (Requests, Controllers, routes/, Provider.php — only folders needed).
- Shared: `app/Shared/Features`, `Settings`, `Support`, `Contracts`.
- Controllers: HTTP only; Request + Data + Action|Query + Resource.
- Migrations: `database/migrations/` and `database/migrations/tenant/` only.
- Tenancy: stancl/tenancy; subdomain; no tenant business data in central DB.
- Features/settings: tenant DB; backend enforcement when feature disabled.

Until Phase 0 is approved, do not generate application code—docs only.

After Phase 1+, CRUD stubs: `stubs/` + skill **leb-generate-crud**.
